The empty node
description: 'yaml/empty — a bare key IS null'
- >
  `key:` with no value — the empty notation. The bare key *is* null, which is also why the type
  lattice's bottom collapses onto null: there is no syntax for an "empty container that is neither
  null nor a committed `{}` / `[]`" ([the three facets](::language:model:facets)).
